      <slug></slug>
      <title>Introduction to pkgsrc, and to package creation in NetBSD</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>BSD Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;pkgsrc is a cross systems packaging system, used in NetBSD, but also DragonflyBSD, MirBSD, Minix3 and a lot more. Through the example of shotwell, a digital pictures management application, this talk will give an introduction to pkgsrc for users and packagers.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1631">Guillaume Lasmayous</person>
          <person id="1632">Emile Heitor</person>
      </persons>
